window.__D=["Don Ramón's small watch-repair workshop in an old house in Guadalajara on a Sunday morning: a wooden workbench with tiny tools, a magnifying lamp and open watch movements, dozens of antique wall clocks ticking on a green wall, a white wire birdcage with a yellow canary by the window, an old wooden radio on a shelf, a framed photo of a smiling older woman, warm tungsten light mixed with soft daylight", "Cinematic 16:9 frame from a prestige near-future anthology TV drama, photorealistic live action, anamorphic 40mm lens look, shallow depth of field, muted cool teal-grey color grade with soft natural light, Mexico a few years in the future with sleek discreet technology, natural skin texture, subtle film grain, restrained naturalistic acting.", "Don Ramón is a 71-year-old Mexican man with brown weathered skin, thick white hair combed back, a neat white mustache, reading glasses hanging on a cord around his neck, a beige knitted cardigan over a light-blue checked shirt", "an idealized spotless version of an old watch-repair workshop: every antique clock perfectly aligned on a green wall, a tidy wooden workbench, soft golden perfect light, no dust at all, slightly too perfect, like a catalog", "a modern minimalist apartment in Mexico City at night: grey sofa, a big TV on the wall, a laptop on the coffee table, rain on the window, dim cold light from the screens, a framed photo of an older couple on a shelf", "Framed as the front camera of a video call: medium close-up, the person looks straight into the lens and talks to the viewer as if to a loved one, perfectly lit, a warm flawless smile, eyes slightly too steady.", "a sleek glass-walled startup office on a high floor in Mexico City at night: the city lights through floor-to-ceiling windows, a long white table with laptops, a whiteboard full of graphs, cold blue LED light", "Lucía is a 42-year-old Mexican woman with brown skin, shoulder-length wavy black hair with a few grey strands tied in a low ponytail, no makeup, tired kind eyes, teal nurse scrubs under an open grey cardigan", "the front door of Don Ramón's watch-repair shop in Guadalajara at dusk in December: the metal shutter half down, a black mourning bow on the door, dry flowers on the step, neighbors' Christmas lights", "a small shaded plaza in a Guadalajara neighborhood on a Sunday afternoon: a folding table with dominoes under big laurel trees, a white kiosk, colorful old houses, dappled warm sunlight", "Doña Carmen's small old kitchen at night: a single hanging lamp over a table with an embroidered tablecloth, a sugar bowl, a clay jar, a round wall clock, saint pictures, dark window", "Daniel is a 37-year-old Mexican man with light-brown skin, short black hair with a fade, a short trimmed black beard, tired eyes, a slim navy suit with a white shirt and no tie", "inside an old small hatchback car parked on a Guadalajara street in the evening: dashboard, a hospital badge hanging from the mirror, streetlights through the windshield", "an immaculate bright minimalist living room in soft perfect daylight: a white sofa, a green plant, white walls, everything clean and slightly too perfect, like a catalog", "Doña Carmen is a 69-year-old Mexican woman with short permed grey hair, round gold-rimmed glasses, a lilac blouse under a cream cardigan, a small gold medal necklace", "a huge modern dark auditorium in Mexico City at a tech product launch: tiered seats full of people, a giant LED screen above a minimalist stage, warm spotlights", "No on-screen text, no subtitles, no captions, no logos, no watermark. Only the spoken lines written here, natural Mexican Spanish accent, no background music.", "the front door of Don Ramón's watch-repair shop in an old Guadalajara street on a sunny Sunday: a painted sign, the metal shutter open, potted plants", "Inés is a 34-year-old Mexican woman with fair olive skin, long straight dark-brown hair, seven months pregnant, an oversized beige knit sweater", "Continuing the same conversation from the previous shot, same moment, same lighting, same clothes, the characters stay exactly where they were.", "Don Chuy is a 74-year-old stout Mexican man, bald with a white horseshoe of hair, a thick grey-and-black mustache, a white guayabera shirt", "a public hospital room at night in Guadalajara: a single bed, a heart monitor, an oxygen tube, a curtain, a window with the dark city", "Valeria Roca, an elegant 45-year-old Mexican woman with a sleek black low bun, a white minimalist suit and a thin headset microphone", "inside a modern car driving on a highway to Guadalajara at sunset in December: the golden light, an infant car seat in the back", "Mariana is a 38-year-old Mexican woman with fair skin, a sleek chestnut bob haircut, small pearl earrings, a white silk blouse", "the facade of a big public hospital in Guadalajara at night: an emergency entrance sign glowing red, an ambulance, wet asphalt", "the porch of Doña Carmen's colorful old house at dusk: potted geraniums, a metal rocking chair, a warm porch light", "a hospital corridor at night in Guadalajara: pale green walls, fluorescent lights, a stretcher, a nurses' station", "the back seat of a taxi at night in Mexico City: passing city lights and rain on the window", "The birdcage is a small white wire birdcage with a yellow canary inside.", "The pocket watch is an old gold pocket watch with an open engraved lid.", "No on-screen text, no subtitles, no captions, no logos, no watermark.", "The phone is a thin frameless glass smartphone.", "Empty establishing shot, no people: ", "says in Mexican Spanish, ", " looks exactly like the ", "character reference. ", "Characters: ", "Setting: "];window.__P=Object.assign(window.__P||{},{"scene-002": ["~1~ ~38~~0~. ~37~~2~. ~30~ ~32~ Don Ramón sits at his workbench with a jeweler's loupe in one eye, working on the open pocket watch; the clocks tick; the phone on the bench lights up and buzzes; he lifts the loupe and grins like a child. Don Ramón ~34~delighted, to himself: \"¡Ándale! Ya sabía yo que no me ibas a fallar.\" ~16~", ["Don Ramón", "ESC:taller"], 8], "scene-003": ["~1~ ~38~~0~. ~37~~2~. ~30~ ~32~ ~19~ Medium close-up: Don Ramón holds the phone up in front of his face for a video call, beaming, and shows the open gold pocket watch to the camera. Don Ramón ~34~warm, teasing: \"¿Qué pasó, Chato? Pensé que hoy no ibas a poder. Mira, te estoy arreglando el reloj del abuelo. Para el niño.\" ~16~", ["Don Ramón", "ESC:taller"], 10], "scene-004": ["~1~ ~38~~13~. ~37~~11~. ~5~ Daniel, freshly shaved and groomed, wearing a soft cream knit sweater instead of a suit, smiles warmly. Daniel ~34~warm, loving: \"¿Cómo no, papá? Es domingo. ¿Y esa rodilla?\" ~16~", ["Daniel", "ESC:perfecto"], 8], "scene-005": ["~1~ ~38~~0~. ~37~~2~. ~29~ ~32~ ~19~ Don Ramón rubs his knee and laughs, then his smile fades as he looks at the silent yellow canary in its cage by the window. Don Ramón ~34~laughing, then softer and sad: \"Terca, como yo. Oye, el Paco ya no canta. Desde que se fue tu mamá, ya no canta.\" ~16~", ["Don Ramón", "ESC:taller"], 10], "scene-006": ["~1~ ~38~~13~. ~37~~11~. ~5~ Daniel, in the soft cream knit sweater, tilts his head tenderly. Daniel ~34~gentle, reassuring: \"Ponle la estación de boleros, la que ponía mamá en las mañanas. Vas a ver que canta.\" ~16~", ["Daniel", "ESC:perfecto"], 10], "scene-008": ["~1~ ~38~~6~. ~37~~11~. ~32~ Night. Daniel, exhausted, tie-less, sits at the long table in a meeting; his phone vibrates face up on the table; he glances at it without picking it up, flips it face down and speaks to a colleague off-screen. Daniel ~34~tired, impatient: \"No, sigue, sigue. ¿Cómo vamos con los inversionistas?\" ~16~", ["Daniel", "ESC:oficina"], 8], "scene-014": ["~1~ ~38~~4~. ~37~~18~; ~11~. Inés~35~Inés ~36~Daniel~35~Daniel ~36~Inés sits on the grey sofa with a hand on her pregnant belly, the TV glowing; Daniel works on the laptop at the other end of the sofa without looking up. She speaks first, he answers without lifting his eyes. Inés ~34~tired, a little sad: \"¿Otra vez no le llamaste a tu papá?\" Daniel ~34~distracted: \"Le llamo el domingo.\" ~16~", ["Inés", "Daniel", "ESC:depto"], 10], "scene-015": ["~1~ ~38~~4~. ~37~~18~; ~11~. Inés~35~Inés ~36~Daniel~35~Daniel ~36~~19~ Close-up of Inés looking at him; then a silent reverse shot of Daniel stopping typing, guilty. Inés ~34~quiet, disappointed: \"Eso dijiste hace tres domingos, Dani.\" ~16~", ["Inés", "Daniel", "ESC:depto"], 8], "scene-017": ["~1~ ~38~~4~. ~37~~11~. Late night, Inés is gone. Close-up of Daniel lit by the laptop screen; he smiles despite himself. Daniel ~34~softly amused: \"Chato. Me dice Chato.\" ~16~", ["Daniel", "ESC:depto"], 8], "scene-019": ["~1~ ~38~~4~. ~37~~11~. ~19~ Daniel laughs quietly and shakes his head, lit by the laptop. Daniel ~34~laughing quietly: \"Daniel Alejandro Ortega. Completo.\" ~16~", ["Daniel", "ESC:depto"], 8], "scene-021": ["~1~ ~38~~4~. ~37~~11~. ~19~ Daniel's smile fades; a long silence; he looks at the framed photo of his parents on the shelf, then answers very quietly, his eyes wet. Daniel ~34~very quiet, ashamed: \"Que mi mamá se murió… y yo no llegué.\" ~16~", ["Daniel", "ESC:depto"], 10], "scene-027": ["~1~ ~38~~9~. ~37~~20~; ~14~; ~2~. Don Chuy~35~Don Chuy ~36~Doña Carmen~35~Doña Carmen ~36~Don Ramón~35~Don Ramón ~36~Fixed blocking: Don Chuy on the LEFT, Doña Carmen in the CENTER, Don Ramón on the RIGHT, around the dominoes table. Don Chuy slams a domino tile on the table, proud and loud; Doña Carmen nods. Don Chuy ~34~loud, proud: \"¡Mi hija me habla diario, compadre! ¡Diario! Antes ni en mi cumpleaños.\" ~16~", ["Don Chuy", "Doña Carmen", "Don Ramón", "ESC:plaza"], 10], "scene-028": ["~1~ ~38~~9~. ~37~~14~; ~20~; ~2~. Doña Carmen~35~Doña Carmen ~36~Don Chuy~35~Don Chuy ~36~Don Ramón~35~Don Ramón ~36~~19~ Fixed blocking: Don Chuy on the LEFT, Doña Carmen in the CENTER, Don Ramón on the RIGHT. Doña Carmen smiles, proud, adjusting her glasses. Doña Carmen ~34~proud, sweet: \"La mía también. Hasta se acuerda de mis pastillas.\" ~16~", ["Doña Carmen", "Don Chuy", "Don Ramón", "ESC:plaza"], 8], "scene-029": ["~1~ ~38~~9~. ~37~~2~; ~20~; ~14~. Don Ramón~35~Don Ramón ~36~Don Chuy~35~Don Chuy ~36~Doña Carmen~35~Doña Carmen ~36~~19~ Fixed blocking: Don Chuy on the LEFT, Doña Carmen in the CENTER, Don Ramón on the RIGHT. Don Ramón places a tile with a flourish, beaming; the others laugh. Don Ramón ~34~beaming, proud: \"El Chato me cuenta todo. Como si viviera aquí a la vuelta.\" ~16~", ["Don Ramón", "Don Chuy", "Doña Carmen", "ESC:plaza"], 10], "scene-032": ["~1~ ~38~~0~. ~37~~7~; ~2~. ~32~ Lucía~35~Lucía ~36~Don Ramón~35~Don Ramón ~36~Lucía, in her nurse scrubs, comes into the workshop holding grocery bags and a weekly pill organizer; Don Ramón, on a video call, covers the phone with his hand and answers without looking at her. Lucía ~34~cheerful, tired: \"Papá, te traje tus pastillas de la semana.\" Don Ramón ~34~distracted, happy: \"Ahorita, mija. Estoy con tu hermano.\" ~16~", ["Lucía", "Don Ramón", "ESC:taller"], 10], "scene-033": ["~1~ ~38~~0~. ~37~~7~; ~2~. Lucía~35~Lucía ~36~Don Ramón~35~Don Ramón ~36~~19~ Close-up of Lucía putting the bags down slowly, hurt. Lucía ~34~hurt, quiet: \"Yo vengo cada domingo, papá. Cada domingo.\" ~16~", ["Lucía", "Don Ramón", "ESC:taller"], 8], "scene-034": ["~1~ ~38~~0~. ~37~~2~; ~7~. ~32~ Don Ramón~35~Don Ramón ~36~Lucía~35~Lucía ~36~~19~ Don Ramón answers kindly, without malice, smiling at the phone; then a silent close-up of Lucía swallowing her tears. Don Ramón ~34~kind, oblivious: \"Ya sé, mija. Pero tu hermano sí me escucha.\" ~16~", ["Don Ramón", "Lucía", "ESC:taller"], 10], "scene-035": ["~1~ ~38~~12~. ~37~~7~. ~32~ Evening. Lucía sits in her parked car with the phone at her ear, annoyed, rubbing her forehead. Lucía ~34~annoyed, suspicious: \"¿Desde cuándo le hablas diario a papá?\" ~16~", ["Lucía", "ESC:auto_lucia"], 10], "scene-036": ["~1~ ~38~~6~. ~37~~11~. ~32~ Daniel walks in the glass office with the phone at his ear, confused; he stops, looks at the screen, then puts it back to his ear. Daniel ~34~confused, then covering: \"¿Diario? … Ah. Sí. Sí, le hablo.\" ~16~", ["Daniel", "ESC:oficina"], 10], "scene-038": ["~1~ ~38~~12~. ~37~~7~. ~32~ ~19~ Lucía softens, leaning her head back on the seat, smiling sadly. Lucía ~34~softer, sincere: \"Qué bueno, Dani. Te extraña mucho. Vente en Navidad, ¿sí?\" ~16~", ["Lucía", "ESC:auto_lucia"], 10], "scene-039": ["~1~ ~38~~6~. ~37~~11~. ~32~ ~19~ Daniel looks at the city through the glass, guilty, the phone at his ear. Daniel ~34~hesitant: \"Sí… Sí voy.\" ~16~", ["Daniel", "ESC:oficina"], 8], "scene-041": ["~1~ ~38~~10~. ~37~~14~. ~32~ Doña Carmen sits at her kitchen table on a video call, the phone propped against the sugar bowl; she speaks sweetly but her eyes are watchful, testing. Doña Carmen ~34~sweet, testing: \"Mija, ¿te acuerdas del perro que teníamos en Tepic? El Firulais.\" ~16~", ["Doña Carmen", "ESC:cocina"], 10], "scene-042": ["~1~ ~38~~13~. ~37~~24~. ~5~ Mariana laughs, delighted, nodding. Mariana ~34~delighted, warm: \"¡Ay, el Firulais! ¡Cómo no, mamá! Si dormía conmigo.\" ~16~", ["Mariana", "ESC:perfecto"], 10], "scene-043": ["~1~ ~38~~10~. ~37~~14~. ~32~ ~19~ Very slow push-in on Doña Carmen's face as it freezes; she takes off her glasses. Doña Carmen ~34~barely a breath: \"Nunca tuvimos perro, Mariana.\" ~16~", ["Doña Carmen", "ESC:cocina"], 8], "scene-044": ["~1~ ~38~~13~. ~37~~24~. ~5~ Mariana keeps exactly the same warm smile, unbothered. Mariana ~34~smooth, sweet: \"Ay, mamá, qué cosas dices. ¿Ya te tomaste tu pastilla?\" ~16~", ["Mariana", "ESC:perfecto"], 8], "scene-046": ["~1~ ~38~~9~. ~37~~14~; ~2~. Doña Carmen~35~Doña Carmen ~36~Don Ramón~35~Don Ramón ~36~Next morning, the plaza is empty; Doña Carmen sits next to Don Ramón on a park bench and talks low, holding his arm. Doña Carmen ~34~low, urgent: \"Ramón, no son ellos. Es una aplicación. Mi hija ya me lo confesó.\" ~16~", ["Doña Carmen", "Don Ramón", "ESC:plaza"], 10], "scene-047": ["~1~ ~38~~9~. ~37~~2~; ~14~. Don Ramón~35~Don Ramón ~36~Doña Carmen~35~Doña Carmen ~36~~19~ Don Ramón laughs it off, patting her hand. Don Ramón ~34~amused, dismissive: \"Ay, Carmen. El Chato se acuerda de todo.\" ~16~", ["Don Ramón", "Doña Carmen", "ESC:plaza"], 8], "scene-048": ["~1~ ~38~~9~. ~37~~14~; ~2~. Doña Carmen~35~Doña Carmen ~36~Don Ramón~35~Don Ramón ~36~~19~ Doña Carmen looks him in the eye; Don Ramón's smile slowly disappears. Doña Carmen ~34~serious, gentle: \"¿Y ya le preguntaste algo que no le haya contado a nadie?\" ~16~", ["Doña Carmen", "Don Ramón", "ESC:plaza"], 10], "scene-049": ["~1~ ~38~~26~. ~37~~14~. ~32~ Dusk. Doña Carmen in her rocking chair on the porch, the phone at her ear; she listens, closes her eyes, and answers with a sad, tender resignation. Doña Carmen ~34~tender, resigned: \"No, mija. No lo canceles. Que me siga hablando.\" ~16~", ["Doña Carmen", "ESC:porche"], 10], "scene-051": ["~1~ ~38~~0~. ~37~~2~. ~32~ Night, only the magnifying lamp is on. Don Ramón on a video call, serious for the first time, looking into the phone. Don Ramón ~34~serious, slow: \"Chato… ¿dónde estabas tú cuando se murió tu mamá?\" ~16~", ["Don Ramón", "ESC:taller"], 8], "scene-052": ["~1~ ~38~~13~. ~37~~11~. ~5~ Daniel, in the soft cream knit sweater, lowers his eyes for a second, then looks back into the lens with perfect sorrow. Daniel ~34~sorrowful, sincere: \"En el aeropuerto, papá. No alcancé el vuelo. Y nunca te pedí perdón.\" ~16~", ["Daniel", "ESC:perfecto"], 10], "scene-053": ["~1~ ~38~~0~. ~37~~2~. ~32~ ~19~ Don Ramón's eyes fill with tears; relieved, he nods slowly. Don Ramón ~34~moved, relieved: \"Ya, mijo. Ya pasó.\" ~16~", ["Don Ramón", "ESC:taller"], 8], "scene-055": ["~1~ ~38~~27~. ~37~~7~. ~32~ Lucía, in her nurse scrubs, walks fast down the hospital corridor with the phone at her ear, furious. Lucía ~34~furious: \"¡Es una aplicación, Daniel! Carmen me contó todo. ¡Papá habla con un robot!\" ~16~", ["Lucía", "ESC:pasillo"], 10], "scene-056": ["~1~ ~38~~28~. ~37~~11~. ~32~ Daniel in the back of a taxi at night, phone at his ear, defensive, the city lights passing over his face. Daniel ~34~defensive, tired: \"¿Y qué querías? ¿Que no le hablara nadie? Está feliz, Lucía.\" ~16~", ["Daniel", "ESC:taxi"], 10], "scene-057": ["~1~ ~38~~27~. ~37~~7~. ~32~ ~19~ Lucía stops in the corridor, closes her eyes, and says it quietly before hanging up. Lucía ~34~quiet, crushing: \"Está feliz con alguien que no existe.\" ~16~", ["Lucía", "ESC:pasillo"], 8], "scene-060": ["~1~ ~38~~21~. ~37~~2~. ~32~ Night. Don Ramón lies in the hospital bed in a gown with an oxygen tube; weak, he holds the phone above his face on a video call. Don Ramón ~34~weak, hopeful: \"Chato… estoy en el hospital. Me duele el pecho. ¿Vienes?\" ~16~", ["Don Ramón", "ESC:hospital"], 10], "scene-061": ["~1~ ~38~~13~. ~37~~11~. ~5~ Daniel, in the soft cream knit sweater, worried and tender. Daniel ~34~tender, urgent: \"Ya voy, papá. Aguántame. Tomo el primer vuelo.\" ~16~", ["Daniel", "ESC:perfecto"], 8], "scene-062": ["~1~ ~38~~21~. ~37~~2~. ~19~ Don Ramón lowers the phone to his chest and smiles with relief, looking at a nurse off-screen. Don Ramón ~34~weak, happy: \"Ya viene mi hijo.\" ~16~", ["Don Ramón", "ESC:hospital"], 8], "scene-067": ["~1~ ~38~~23~. ~37~~11~; ~18~. Daniel~35~Daniel ~36~Inés~35~Inés ~36~Daniel drives, happy for the first time, wearing a dark jacket; Inés, no longer pregnant, sits in the back next to a newborn baby in the infant car seat and smiles at him in the mirror. Daniel ~34~excited: \"Va a ser la sorpresa de su vida. Ni le dije que veníamos.\" ~16~", ["Daniel", "Inés", "ESC:carretera"], 10], "scene-069": ["~1~ ~38~~8~. ~37~~7~; ~11~. Lucía~35~Lucía ~36~Daniel~35~Daniel ~36~Lucía, dressed in black, opens the shop door; cardboard boxes behind her; Daniel stands outside holding the baby carrier, smiling uncertainly. She speaks first; he answers. Lucía ~34~cold, tired: \"¿Ahora sí vienes?\" Daniel ~34~confused, smiling: \"¿Dónde está papá?\" ~16~", ["Lucía", "Daniel", "ESC:puerta"], 10], "scene-070": ["~1~ ~38~~8~. ~37~~7~; ~11~. Lucía~35~Lucía ~36~Daniel~35~Daniel ~36~~19~ Close-up of Lucía, dressed in black, eyes red, very calm. Lucía ~34~calm, devastating: \"Lo enterramos hace tres semanas. Te hablé, Daniel. Me dijiste que no alcanzabas vuelo.\" ~16~", ["Lucía", "Daniel", "ESC:puerta"], 10], "scene-071": ["~1~ ~38~~8~. ~37~~11~; ~7~. ~32~ Daniel~35~Daniel ~36~Lucía~35~Lucía ~36~~19~ Daniel goes pale; he shakes his head and pulls the phone out of his pocket with trembling hands. Daniel ~34~stunned, stammering: \"Yo nunca… Yo no…\" ~16~", ["Daniel", "Lucía", "ESC:puerta"], 8], "scene-073": ["~1~ ~38~~8~. ~37~~7~; ~11~. Lucía~35~Lucía ~36~Daniel~35~Daniel ~36~~19~ Lucía, dressed in black, speaks without anger, tears running down; Daniel in soft focus with the phone. Lucía ~34~broken, quiet: \"Te estuvo esperando toda la noche. Le decía a la enfermera: ya viene mi hijo, ya viene.\" ~16~", ["Lucía", "Daniel", "ESC:puerta"], 10], "scene-076": ["~1~ ~38~~3~. ~37~~2~. ~5~ Don Ramón, freshly groomed, in a spotless cardigan, in a perfect bright version of his workshop, smiles with joy. Don Ramón ~34~joyful: \"¡Chato! ¿Ya llegaste? Te tengo chilaquiles.\" ~16~", ["Don Ramón", "ESC:taller_perfecto"], 10], "scene-077": ["~1~ ~38~~8~. ~37~~11~. ~32~ Close-up of Daniel holding the phone to his face, crying, barely able to speak. Daniel ~34~crying: \"Papá… perdóname.\" ~16~", ["Daniel", "ESC:puerta"], 8], "scene-078": ["~1~ ~38~~3~. ~37~~2~. ~5~ Don Ramón tilts his head with infinite tenderness. Don Ramón ~34~tender: \"¿Perdonarte de qué, Chato? Si tú nunca faltaste.\" ~16~", ["Don Ramón", "ESC:taller_perfecto"], 10], "scene-079": ["~1~ ~38~~8~. ~37~~7~; ~11~. Lucía~35~Lucía ~36~Daniel~35~Daniel ~36~Lucía, dressed in black, looks at her brother talking to the phone, disgusted and heartbroken; she takes her coat and walks away down the street. Lucía ~34~disgusted, heartbroken: \"Eso no es mi papá.\" ~16~", ["Lucía", "Daniel", "ESC:puerta"], 8], "scene-081": ["~1~ ~38~~0~. ~37~~11~. ~29~ ~32~ ~30~ Night. Daniel sits alone at his father's workbench, the baby carrier beside him and the phone face up on the bench; he turns the knob of the old wooden radio; a soft bolero plays, and the yellow canary starts to sing. Daniel cries in silence. Nobody speaks. Nobody speaks: lips closed, no dialogue, no voice-over. ~16~", ["Daniel", "ESC:taller"], 10]});window.__get=id=>window.__P[id][0].replace(/~(\d+)~/g,(m,n)=>window.__D[+n]);Object.keys(window.__P).length